"NOUN","option"],["for","ADP",""],["information","NOUN",""],["or","CCONJ",""],["action","NOUN",""],null],"text":"The term \"artificial intelligence\" means a machine-based system that can, for a given set of human-defined objectives, make predictions, recommendations or decisions influencing real or virtual environments.Artificial intelligence systems use machine and human-based inputs to—perceive real and virtual environments; abstract such perceptions into models through analysis in an automated manner; anduse model inference to formulate options for information or action.","idx":3,"match_words":["term","artificial","intelligence","mean","machine","base","system","give","set","human","define","make","recommendation","decision","environment","artificial","intelligence","system","use","machine","human","base","input","environment","such","model","analysis","manner","anduse model inference","option","information"],"words":["the","term","artificial","intelligence","mean","a","machine","base","system","that","can","for","a","give","set","of","human","define","objective","make","prediction","recommendation","or","decision","influence","real","or","virtual","environment","artificial","intelligence","system","use","machine","and","human","base","input","to","perceive","real","and","virtual","environment","abstract","such","perception","into","model","through","analysis","in","an","automate","manner","anduse model inference","to","formulate","option","for","information","or","action"],"unmatched_count":32,"match_length":31,"cut_length":63},{"key":"4","text_words":[["the","DET","the"],["term","NOUN",""],["\"","PUNCT",""],["community","NOUN",""],["college","NOUN",""],["\"","PUNCT",""],["means","VERB","mean"],["a","DET",""],["public","ADJ",""],["institution","NOUN",""],["of","ADP",""],["higher","ADJ","high"],["education","NOUN",""],["at","ADP",""],["which","PRON",""],["the","DET",""],["highest","ADJ","high"],["degree","NOUN",""],["that","PRON",""],["is","AUX","be"],["predomin