to artificial intelligence systems that are common across all sectors; provide case studies of framework implementation; align with international standards, as appropriate; incorporate voluntary consensus standards and industry best practices; and not prescribe or otherwise require the use of specific information or communications technology products or services.","idx":75,"match_words":["later","year","the date","the enactment","this act","the director","work","develop","update","collaboration","other","public","private","sector","organization","include","the national science foundation","the department","energy","a voluntary risk management framework","trustworthy","artificial","intelligence","system","the framework","identify","provide","standard","guideline","good","practice","process","develop","trustworthy","artificial","intelligence","system","assess","the trustworthiness","artificial","intelligence","system","risk","artificial","intelligence","system","establish","common","trustworthiness","include","safety","privacy","security","robustness","bias","ethic","validation","verification","other","property","relate","artificial","intelligence","system","common","sector","provide","study","framework implementation","international","standard","appropriate","voluntary","consensus","standard","industry","good","practice","require","the use","specific information","technology","product","service"],"words":["not","later","than","year","after","the date","of","the enactment","of","this act","the director","shall","work","to","develop","and","periodically","update","in","collaboration","with","other","public","and","private","sector","organization","include","the national science foundation","and","the department","of","energy","a voluntary risk management framework","for","trustworthy","artificial","intelligence","system","the framework","shall","identify","and","provide","standard","guideline","good","practice","methodology","procedure","and","process","for","develop",