 high-performance computing infrastructure at national laboratories; make any upgrades necessary to enhance the use of existing computing facilities for artificial intelligence systems, including upgrades to hardware; establish new computing capabilities necessary to manage data and conduct high performance computing that enables the use of artificial intelligence systems; and maintain and improve, as needed, networking infrastructure, data input and output mechanisms, and data analysis, storage, and service capabilities.","idx":111,"match_words":["carry","the program","subsection","the secretary","make","available","high","performance","computing","infrastructure","national","laboratory","make","necessary","enhance","the use","exist","computing","facility","artificial","intelligence","system","include","hardware","establish","new","compute","capability","necessary","manage","datum","conduct","high performance computing","enable","the use","artificial","intelligence","system","maintain","improve","need","network","infrastructure","datum","input","mechanism","datum","analysis","service","capability"],"words":["in","carry","out","the program","under","subsection","the secretary","shall","make","available","high","performance","computing","infrastructure","at","national","laboratory","make","any","upgrade","necessary","to","enhance","the use","of","exist","computing","facility","for","artificial","intelligence","system","include","upgrade","to","hardware","establish","new","compute","capability","necessary","to","manage","datum","and","conduct","high performance computing","that","enable","the use","of","artificial","intelligence","system","and","maintain","and","improve","as","need","network","infrastructure","datum","input","and","output","mechanism","and","datum","analysis","storage","and","service","capability"],"unmatched_count":24,"match_length":50,"cut_length":74},{"key":"112","text_words":[["not","PART","not"],["later","ADV",""],["than","ADP",""],["6","NUM",""]