h","NOUN",""],["projects","NOUN","project"],["or","CCONJ",""],["partnerships","NOUN","partnership"],["that","PRON",""],["require","VERB",""],["sharing","VERB","share"],["sensitive","ADJ",""],["public","ADJ",""],["or","CCONJ",""],["private","ADJ",""],["data","NOUN","datum"],["with","ADP",""],["the","DET",""],["department","PROPN",""],null],"text":"The Secretary shall review agency policies for data sharing with other public and private sector organizations and issue as necessary policies and principles that are consistent with the standards and guidelines submitted under section 22A(e) of the National Institute of Standards and Technology Act (as added by section 5301 of this division).In addition, the Secretary shall establish a streamlined mechanism for approving research projects or partnerships that require sharing sensitive public or private data with the Department.","idx":114,"match_words":["the secretary","review","agency","policy","datum","share","other","public","private","sector","organization","issue","necessary","policy","principle","consistent","standard","guideline","submit","section","the national institute","standards","technology","act","add","section","this division","the secretary","establish","a streamlined mechanism","research","project","partnership","require","share","public","private","datum","the department"],"words":["the secretary","shall","review","agency","policy","for","datum","share","with","other","public","and","private","sector","organization","and","issue","as","necessary","policy","and","principle","that","be","consistent","with","the","standard","and","guideline","submit","under","section","of","the national institute","of","standards","and","technology","act","as","add","by","section","of","this division","in","addition","the secretary","shall","establish","a streamlined mechanism","for","approve","research","project","or","partnership","that","require","share","sensitive","public","or","private","datum","with","the department"]